AtlanticOS: keep genuine ARM pmap and native non-PPL RO protection, without Apple monitor backends.
Apple trust-cache APIs are absent and diagnosed as unavailable, never replaced with successful verifiers.
SART/UAT are excluded only in the laboratory; IOMMU compression panic retains its condition with raw PTE diagnostics.

